  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg01",
      "role": "hook",
      "line": "My best friend Kunal walked into the Diwali night,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 8.77,
        "out": 13.53
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_1",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg02",
      "role": "hook",
      "line": "Priya on his arm, lifting her up in the camera light. And me?",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 14.05,
        "out": 19.93
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_2",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg03",
      "role": "hook",
      "line": "I couldn't even bend to touch my nani's feet.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 23.17,
        "out": 27.57
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_3",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg04",
      "role": "hook",
      "line": "The only reason I held my head up on that street",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 28.35,
        "out": 32.75
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_4",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg05",
      "role": "hook",
      "line": "was what my tailor gave me just the week before. So let me take it back to the start.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 32.75,
        "out": 41.67
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_5",
          "fit": "slow",
          "duration": 5.1
        },
        {
          "clip": "clip_21",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg06",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Me and Priya, six long years, never did get wed, \"Let's wait till you're settled,\" that's all she ever said. And I believed her. Gave that girl my twenties whole,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 47.11,
        "out": 61.15
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_6",
          "fit": "slow",
          "duration": 8.0
        },
        {
          "clip": "clip_1",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg07",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "paid her EMIs, double shifts, drove her papa, played my role.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 61.37,
        "out": 65.69
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_7",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg08",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Planned every birthday while she \"needed space,\"",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 66.09,
        "out": 70.31
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_8",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg09",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "and how'd she pay me back? With my best friend's face. Kunal. My best friend since school.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 70.31,
        "out": 77.63
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_51",
          "fit": "trim",
          "duration": 3.6
        },
        {
          "clip": "clip_9",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg10",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Found out through his own sister in my DMs: \"Bhai, I thought you should know.\"",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 77.63,
        "out": 83.46
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_10",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg11",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Three months later, she moved out the door.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 83.46,
        "out": 87.11
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_11",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg12",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Four months on, I wasn't missing her anymore, I missed who I thought she was.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 87.11,
        "out": 93.47
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_12",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg13",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Mostly I was in pain, the kind no sleep could fix,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 96.79,
        "out": 100.78
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_13",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg14",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "thirty-six, but in the mirror I looked fifty, no tricks.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 100.78,
        "out": 105.65
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_14",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg15",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Twelve-hour days on my bike, my back locked every dawn,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 106.07,
        "out": 110.02
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_15",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg16",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "my knees cracked on the stairs, every bit of me was gone.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 110.02,
        "out": 114.76
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_16",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg17",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "I tried it all: physio, the gym at six a.m.,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 114.76,
        "out": 119.77
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_17",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg18",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "the belts, the sprays, the balms, I bought every one of them.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 120.07,
        "out": 124.51
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_18",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg19",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Painkillers till my stomach burned, the ache came right back.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 125.35,
        "out": 128.98
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_19",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg20",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "My body gave up on me the same way Priya did, just like that.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 128.98,
        "out": 135.49
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_20",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg21",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Then I'm at Iqbal chacha's for my Diwali kurta fit,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 141.25,
        "out": 145.55
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_21",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg22",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "twelve years he's stitched my clothes, he knows me every bit.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 145.95,
        "out": 150.29
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_22",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg23",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Mid-measurement he says, \"Stand straight.\" I can't. He stops.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 150.87,
        "out": 154.24
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_29",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg24",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "\"What's going on with you?\" Right there, tears dropped.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 154.24,
        "out": 158.2
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_24",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg25",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Under his counter, he pulled out a bottle with herbs on it.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 158.2,
        "out": 161.66
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_25",
          "fit": "hold"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg26",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "\"My client who's a physiotherapist put me onto this.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 161.66,
        "out": 165.14
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_26",
          "fit": "hold"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg27",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Not those sprays, not the YouTube nuskhe, no, fifteen Ayurvedic herbs in warm til oil, it goes in deep and slow.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 165.14,
        "out": 172.1
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_27",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg28",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "\"Chacha, I'm not spending more on something that does nothing.\"",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 172.1,
        "out": 175.91
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_28",
          "fit": "hold"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg29",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "He looked me dead in the eyes: \"If it doesn't work, your stitching's free for a year.\"",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 176.13,
        "out": 181.13
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_29",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg30",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Twelve years, never one rupee off.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 181.41,
        "out": 184.13
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_30",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg31",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "So I took it home, rubbed it in every night before bed.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 184.87,
        "out": 188.66
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_31",
          "fit": "hold"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg32",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "A week in, I texted him, \"Why is this working?\" I said,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 188.66,
        "out": 192.39
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_32",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg33",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "\"when nothing else did?\" And he wrote back: \"Because it was never just your back.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 192.39,
        "out": 199.46
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_33",
          "fit": "trim",
          "duration": 3.62
        },
        {
          "clip": "clip_16",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg34",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Twelve hours on that bike and all that stress, your muscles stayed tight, inflamed, a mess.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 199.46,
        "out": 204.8
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_34",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg35",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Sprays sit on the skin, an hour later they're gone,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 204.8,
        "out": 207.08
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_35",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg36",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "warm oil massaged in slow gets down where it's wrong. No oil fixes your whole life, that's true,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 207.08,
        "out": 211.9
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_36",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg37",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "but sleeping without pain is a good start for you.\"",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 211.9,
        "out": 215.23
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_13",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg38",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "It's called EIS Ayurvedic Pain Relief Oil,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 215.83,
        "out": 220.4
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_38",
          "fit": "hold"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg39",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Mahanarayan, Nirgundi, Ashwagandha,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 221.05,
        "out": 224.17
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_39",
          "fit": "hold"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg40",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Week one, I slept straight through the night. Week two, the morning stiffness started feeling light.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 224.93,
        "out": 234.31
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_37",
          "fit": "slow",
          "duration": 4.4
        },
        {
          "clip": "clip_40",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg41",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Week three, the stairs stopped scaring me.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 234.31,
        "out": 238.61
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_41",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg42",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "A month in, cross-legged at puja, I got up free, didn't even hold the wall.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 238.89,
        "out": 245.92
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_32",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg43",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Six weeks in, the society match, twenty overs, played it all. Not the old me.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 245.92,
        "out": 255.49
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_4",
          "fit": "slow",
          "duration": 4.8
        },
        {
          "clip": "clip_14",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg44",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "The me I was supposed to be.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 257.8,
        "out": 262.25
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_44",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg45",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Next society function, first one on the floor, in that same Diwali kurta, standing tall once more.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 266.16,
        "out": 274.28
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_45",
          "fit": "slow"
        },
        {
          "clip": "clip_52",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg46",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Nothing extra. No belt. No painkiller.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 274.28,
        "out": 278.16
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_46",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg47",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "And there's Priya. Kunal next to her.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 278.16,
        "out": 283.85
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_47",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg48",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "My nani walks in, I bend, touch her feet, come up smooth.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 283.85,
        "out": 288.07
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_48",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg49",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Priya's face changed,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 288.61,
        "out": 290.65
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_49",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg50",
      "role": "cta",
      "line": "that's a bonus, see,",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 290.65,
        "out": 292.57
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_59",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg51",
      "role": "cta",
      "line": "but it's not for her anymore. It's for me.",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
